1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

2
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

3
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kaki narase sonzai wo</b></font></font></font>

4
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>rock away your existence</b></font></font></font>

5
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>koko ni iru to</b></font></font></font>

6
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>shouting that you are here</b></font></font></font>

7
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>arata na tabi ga ima hajimaru</b></font></font></font>

8
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>a new journey begins now</b></font></font></font>

9
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kawari yuku kisetsu no naka wo ikinuku tabi ni bokura</b></font></font></font>

10
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>as we survived through the changing seasons</b></font></font></font>

11
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>chie to tsuyosa wo te ni ireta kedo JUST LOOKS LIKE SURVIVAL GAME</b></font></font></font>

12
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we gained knowledge and strength (just looks like a survival game)</b></font></font></font>

13
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>nagareteku jikan no naka ni</b></font></font></font>

14
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but the forgotten memories</b></font></font></font>

15
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>okizari ni shita omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>of the feelings abandoned within the flows of time</b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>wasureta koto sura wasurete ita</b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>have also been lost</b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kuzure kaketa toki kodoku wo shitte</b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>when sinking down we learned loneliness</b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:55,170 --> 00:01:57,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, it's a case of not being able to fight
with the leader</font>

32
00:01:57,550 --> 00:01:59,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">unless I defeat the underlings?</font>

33
00:01:59,590 --> 00:02:00,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, then...</font>

34
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:07,070
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Clash of Tears!</font>

35
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:07,070
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Hot-Blooded Master-Disciple Battle</font>

36
00:02:09,190 --> 00:02:12,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, you think you've blackened the path
to this Might Guy's tomorrow with this?</font>

37
00:02:13,570 --> 00:02:17,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Youth is breaking through
the walls that close you in.</font>

38
00:02:17,740 --> 00:02:20,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you have both passion and effort,
then nothing is impossible!</font>

39
00:02:20,660 --> 00:02:21,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With our sights trained on tomorrow!</font>

40
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:31,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is there no tomorrow for us?</font>

41
00:02:32,210 --> 00:02:34,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, this wood retains
its incredible strength</font>

42
00:02:34,670 --> 00:02:37,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because it is reinforced
and connected by Chakra, I see.</font>

43
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:41,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei.</font>

44
00:02:41,340 --> 00:02:42,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yagura?</font>

45
00:02:42,850 --> 00:02:44,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you all right?!</font>

46
00:02:47,930 --> 00:02:50,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not Yagura.</font>

47
00:02:55,190 --> 00:02:58,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eldest of the three Ryudouin brothers,
Gensho!</font>

48
00:02:58,990 --> 00:03:00,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Second son of the same, Rokkaku!</font>

49
00:03:00,780 --> 00:03:02,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Third son, Jako!</font>

50
00:03:03,830 --> 00:03:05,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ryudouin?</font>

51
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:09,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think I've heard of that somewhere.</font>

52
00:03:09,910 --> 00:03:11,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't tell me that you don't remember!</font>

53
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:16,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our father, Ryudouin Agira,
was deeply injured</font>

54
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:20,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by the cowardly strategies
of your Hidden Leaf Shinobi.</font>

55
00:03:21,090 --> 00:03:25,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And unable to execute his missions,
he passed away in despair.</font>

56
00:03:26,260 --> 00:03:28,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our father resented you to the very end,</font>

57
00:03:28,850 --> 00:03:31,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even muttering your name
on his deathbed...</font>

58
00:03:32,190 --> 00:03:35,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">telling us to fight
with Might Guy of Hidden Leaf Village.</font>

59
00:03:36,070 --> 00:03:37,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From that day forth,</font>

60
00:03:37,150 --> 00:03:41,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">our objective has been
to avenge his death!</font>

61
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:45,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes! We have been lying in wait
for the time to get even with you!</font>

62
00:03:47,330 --> 00:03:49,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you mean that Agira?!</font>

63
00:03:50,370 --> 00:03:53,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way I could forget that battle.</font>

64
00:03:53,620 --> 00:03:57,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Although we were enemies
on our missions, Agira was a fine man.</font>

65
00:03:58,500 --> 00:04:01,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That will remain in my memory
as a splendid contest, even within</font>

66
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:03,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the annals
of the complete eight-volume</font>

67
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:05,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Might Guy's History of Famous Battles.</font>

68
00:04:10,020 --> 00:04:12,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a man-to-man fight.</font>

69
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:21,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing happened that dishonoured
my Way of Ninja!</font>

70
00:04:21,650 --> 00:04:23,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You three must be mistaken.</font>

71
00:04:23,820 --> 00:04:26,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't be angry at you,
so let me out of here!</font>

72
00:04:26,990 --> 00:04:30,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool! I shall wreak vengeance
upon you to settle my father's score.</font>

73
00:04:30,950 --> 00:04:32,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll finish you off!</font>

74
00:04:54,100 --> 00:04:55,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura,</font>

75
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:59,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I noticed you were there some time ago.</font>

76
00:04:59,690 --> 00:05:03,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My master told me to make sure
you don't overdo it.</font>

77
00:05:03,990 --> 00:05:05,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're hiding something, aren't you?!</font>

78
00:05:05,660 --> 00:05:08,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... Nothing!</font>

79
00:05:10,540 --> 00:05:12,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, you're not very good at lying.</font>

80
00:05:18,750 --> 00:05:19,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

81
00:05:28,340 --> 00:05:30,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die, Might Guy! Enemy of our father!</font>

82
00:05:34,390 --> 00:05:35,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, I tell you!</font>

83
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:40,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you Yagura imposter,
infiltrating Village Hidden in the Leaves,</font>

84
00:05:40,940 --> 00:05:42,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">what are you scheming?!</font>

85
00:05:45,110 --> 00:05:46,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

86
00:05:49,820 --> 00:05:55,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy is in that building! The building is
controlled by their Chakra!</font>

87
00:05:55,580 --> 00:05:56,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why you...</font>

88
00:06:08,550 --> 00:06:11,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Intense Brow Sensei,
I'm coming to your rescue!</font>

89
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:16,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this?!</font>

90
00:06:21,060 --> 00:06:24,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you intend to shut us in
with these pieces of wood?</font>

91
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:28,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Don't underestimate us!
— Stop it, Naruto!</font>

92
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:43,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wooden Dummies for training?</font>

93
00:06:47,010 --> 00:06:49,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are these also controlled by those three?</font>

94
00:06:50,050 --> 00:06:51,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However strong they are,</font>

95
00:06:51,260 --> 00:06:54,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they couldn't move all
of these Wooden Dummies at once.</font>

96
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:58,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's hard to believe those three would
have that much power.</font>

97
00:06:58,770 --> 00:07:00,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

98
00:07:06,110 --> 00:07:07,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

99
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:09,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They have a simple mechanism,</font>

100
00:07:10,030 --> 00:07:13,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and their movements are controlled
by the labels on the back of their heads.</font>

101
00:07:13,530 --> 00:07:15,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, they're not moved with Puppet Jutsu?</font>

102
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:19,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, they're only designed
for repeated punches and kicks,</font>

103
00:07:19,710 --> 00:07:21,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so they probably cannot respond
to our movements!</font>

104
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:24,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does this mean their movements can
be halted by removing the labels?</font>

105
00:07:24,880 --> 00:07:26,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, that's what it's all about!</font>

106
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:31,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's the case,
then I'll return that blow!</font>

107
00:07:31,510 --> 00:07:33,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multi Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

108
00:07:37,100 --> 00:07:38,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here goes!</font>

109
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:54,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once I know the weak spot,
you're all mine!</font>

110
00:08:01,790 --> 00:08:03,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Gotcha!
— Gotcha!</font>

111
00:08:09,670 --> 00:08:10,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is easy!</font>

112
00:08:13,090 --> 00:08:15,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These Wooden Dummies are
just one small part of our Jutsu!</font>

113
00:08:17,470 --> 00:08:19,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art:
Wooden Dummy Manipulation Jutsu!</font>

114
00:08:31,530 --> 00:08:32,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn you!</font>

115
00:08:35,870 --> 00:08:36,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Keep your wits about you!</font>

116
00:08:36,910 --> 00:08:38,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's one that moves differently
from the others!</font>

117
00:08:41,660 --> 00:08:42,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji!</font>

118
00:08:49,460 --> 00:08:52,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">U-zu-ma-ki...</font>

119
00:08:54,050 --> 00:08:55,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto Barra...!</font>

120
00:09:00,970 --> 00:09:02,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stay back!</font>

121
00:09:03,020 --> 00:09:06,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Some of these Wooden Dummies seem
to be manipulated by the Puppet Jutsu.</font>

122
00:09:06,560 --> 00:09:07,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful!</font>

123
00:09:28,830 --> 00:09:30,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Lee!
— Bushy Brow!</font>

124
00:09:32,710 --> 00:09:34,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Hurricane!</font>

125
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:35,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee?!</font>

126
00:09:35,930 --> 00:09:38,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How did you know we were here?!</font>

127
00:09:38,260 --> 00:09:39,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From what Sakura told us,</font>

128
00:09:39,890 --> 00:09:42,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I felt certain
that Guy-sensei would take this route</font>

129
00:09:42,140 --> 00:09:44,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if he were headed
for the Land of Mountain Streams.</font>

130
00:09:45,890 --> 00:09:47,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And where is Guy-sensei?</font>

131
00:09:48,650 --> 00:09:49,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inside there.</font>

132
00:10:02,830 --> 00:10:05,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?
— Are they running away?</font>

133
00:10:16,130 --> 00:10:17,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's happening?!</font>

134
00:10:32,860 --> 00:10:35,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just like a castle!</font>

135
00:10:35,530 --> 00:10:37,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave this to me!</font>

136
00:10:38,490 --> 00:10:42,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei is my master!
I would risk my life to save him!</font>

137
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:47,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, Bushy Brow,
your leg injury hasn't healed yet.</font>

138
00:10:47,540 --> 00:10:48,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going in!</font>

139
00:10:49,040 --> 00:10:50,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's reckless!</font>

140
00:10:54,710 --> 00:10:56,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you intend to interfere?</font>

141
00:10:57,460 --> 00:10:59,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today, I am just a bit different
from usual...!</font>

142
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:04,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bushy Brow, we'll cover you.</font>

143
00:11:04,810 --> 00:11:07,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is a weak point in the Chakra
at the center of the castle.</font>

144
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:08,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you hit there, then...</font>

145
00:11:08,810 --> 00:11:10,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it may be a trap!</font>

146
00:11:12,100 --> 00:11:16,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone... if it is a trap,
let's try falling into it intentionally.</font>

147
00:11:24,410 --> 00:11:25,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over there!</font>

148
00:11:26,160 --> 00:11:28,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dynamic Entry!</font>

149
00:11:33,790 --> 00:11:36,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As we suspected,
it was a trap to lure me in.</font>

150
00:11:37,710 --> 00:11:40,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, let's follow it through.</font>

151
00:11:45,550 --> 00:11:49,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rokkaku, Jako, leave the rest to me.</font>

152
00:11:50,310 --> 00:11:51,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.</font>

153
00:11:51,390 --> 00:11:54,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take revenge on that coward
by a suitable method.</font>

154
00:11:56,110 --> 00:11:57,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to me.</font>

155
00:11:58,690 --> 00:12:01,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wooden Dummy: Possess:
Transfer: Repossess Jutsu!</font>

156
00:12:13,460 --> 00:12:15,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Wooden Dummy here, too?</font>

157
00:12:15,750 --> 00:12:18,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your teacher is an incredible liar, Lee.</font>

158
00:12:18,710 --> 00:12:21,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that Yagura's voice I hear?</font>

159
00:12:21,130 --> 00:12:23,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll teach you both, master and student,</font>

160
00:12:23,090 --> 00:12:27,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that sometimes passion
and effort alone come to naught.</font>

161
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:29,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't allow you to speak ill
of my teacher.</font>

162
00:12:29,850 --> 00:12:31,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you've got something to say,</font>

163
00:12:31,060 --> 00:12:32,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then why don't you come out here
and say it?</font>

164
00:12:32,890 --> 00:12:34,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no need.</font>

165
00:12:34,400 --> 00:12:38,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can amply prove it with the Wooden Dummy
that is my incarnation.</font>

166
00:12:38,400 --> 00:12:40,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have come to rescue my teacher!</font>

167
00:12:40,730 --> 00:12:43,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way
I'm going to let myself lose to you!</font>

168
00:12:44,070 --> 00:12:45,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You make me laugh.</font>

169
00:12:49,790 --> 00:12:51,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this? The Leaf Hurricane...?</font>

170
00:12:51,950 --> 00:12:55,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does this mean that the technique
I deployed that time</font>

171
00:12:55,330 --> 00:12:58,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">has been completely imitated
and mastered by Yagura?!</font>

172
00:12:59,880 --> 00:13:00,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case...</font>

173
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:04,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf's Severe Hurricane!</font>

174
00:13:09,010 --> 00:13:10,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can this really be Yagura?</font>

175
00:13:11,390 --> 00:13:12,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he's mastered not
only offensive moves,</font>

176
00:13:12,810 --> 00:13:15,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but also learned to guard
with such perfection,</font>

177
00:13:15,390 --> 00:13:17,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then he truly must be a genius!</font>

178
00:13:18,310 --> 00:13:20,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What an incredibly powerful spinning kick.</font>

179
00:13:20,860 --> 00:13:22,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Gensho I faced off with
in the practice hall</font>

180
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:23,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">did not have this much power.</font>

181
00:13:24,150 --> 00:13:25,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To my knowledge,</font>

182
00:13:25,700 --> 00:13:29,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there is only one person
who could let loose this powerful a kick.</font>

183
00:13:30,870 --> 00:13:33,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are student and teacher
who respect each other.</font>

184
00:13:33,250 --> 00:13:35,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dying fighting each other must be
a wish come true.</font>

185
00:13:35,210 --> 00:13:36,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll have them crush each other</font>

186
00:13:36,620 --> 00:13:38,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with Wooden Dummies mimicking
each other's movements.</font>

187
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:43,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if each were to discover
the true identity of his opponent...</font>

188
00:13:43,510 --> 00:13:46,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They can't escape from the confrontation</font>

189
00:13:46,180 --> 00:13:48,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without defeating
the Wooden Dummies before their eyes.</font>

190
00:13:49,180 --> 00:13:50,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is the secret</font>

191
00:13:50,890 --> 00:13:53,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of Wooden Dummy: Possess:
Transfer: Repossess Jutsu!</font>

192
00:13:57,980 --> 00:13:59,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like my legs can't last
for very long.</font>

193
00:14:00,770 --> 00:14:03,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it comes to this,
there's only one move left.</font>

194
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:05,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei, it's okay, right?</font>

195
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:08,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I use it for your sake,
you'll probably forgive me.</font>

196
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:18,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Lotus?</font>

197
00:14:18,170 --> 00:14:21,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that the one who is
controlling this Wooden Dummy is Lee?</font>

198
00:14:30,930 --> 00:14:32,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dancing Leaf Shadow!</font>

199
00:14:40,650 --> 00:14:45,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A combo move from the Lotus Hit Back
to aerial Severe Leaf Hurricanes!</font>

200
00:14:47,610 --> 00:14:49,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's magnificent. Too magnificent!</font>

201
00:14:49,820 --> 00:14:53,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only Guy-sensei could use
such artful techniques!</font>

202
00:14:53,410 --> 00:14:55,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Splendid! If I had not been his opponent,</font>

203
00:14:56,040 --> 00:14:59,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm 100 percent certain that he would have
toppled the opponent with that Lotus.</font>

204
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:04,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, at this rate,
I won't be able to beat this Jutsu.</font>

205
00:15:05,750 --> 00:15:08,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait! There is a way.</font>

206
00:15:18,350 --> 00:15:24,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That tapping is Morse Code.
"You and I are destroying each other."</font>

207
00:15:25,520 --> 00:15:28,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But there's no way for either
of us to end this fight</font>

208
00:15:28,280 --> 00:15:29,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without defeating the enemy's Jutsu.</font>

209
00:15:30,700 --> 00:15:33,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, it was Guy-sensei
that I was fighting all along?</font>

210
00:15:35,160 --> 00:15:38,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We must both create an attack
with speed and power</font>

211
00:15:38,750 --> 00:15:41,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of a magnitude that cannot be reproduced
by the Wooden Dummies.</font>

212
00:15:41,710 --> 00:15:46,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"But I cannot show to you
the abyss of death again!"</font>

213
00:15:52,800 --> 00:15:57,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Master Guy, if I do it to protect
the person who is most important to me...</font>

214
00:15:58,560 --> 00:16:01,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"You will forgive me
for using that move, won't you?"</font>

215
00:16:02,690 --> 00:16:06,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To me... To me...</font>

216
00:16:10,150 --> 00:16:15,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"To me, there is no one more important
than Guy-sensei," you say?</font>

217
00:16:17,370 --> 00:16:21,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee! What do you mean
by making me cry at a time like this?</font>

218
00:16:22,210 --> 00:16:25,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee! I haven't forgotten the promise
I made to you back then!</font>

219
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:32,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"If you die... I shall die with you."</font>

220
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:37,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you, Guy-sensei!</font>

221
00:16:38,760 --> 00:16:40,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now is the very time when...</font>

222
00:16:41,310 --> 00:16:43,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One's own Way of Ninja...</font>

223
00:16:43,390 --> 00:16:46,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— must be followed to the very end!
— Must be followed to the very end!</font>

224
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:49,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Third Gate: Gate of Life... Open!</font>

225
00:16:50,820 --> 00:16:53,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fourth Gate: Gate of Pain... Open!</font>

226
00:17:03,160 --> 00:17:04,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei!</font>

227
00:17:05,250 --> 00:17:06,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're far from finished!</font>

228
00:17:18,010 --> 00:17:19,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong, Elder Brother?</font>

229
00:17:20,310 --> 00:17:23,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're fast. They're both too fast.</font>

230
00:17:24,770 --> 00:17:28,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate,
the Wooden Dummies will... break.</font>

231
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:31,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fifth Gate: Gate of Closing!</font>

232
00:17:31,150 --> 00:17:32,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Open!</font>

233
00:17:35,490 --> 00:17:38,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't see them.
They're faster than even sound!</font>

234
00:17:49,250 --> 00:17:51,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There you go, Lee!</font>

235
00:17:51,090 --> 00:17:53,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bring the Chakra of your passions
to bear upon your opponent!</font>

236
00:17:53,670 --> 00:17:54,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

237
00:18:34,800 --> 00:18:37,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— The castle is...
— Crumbling?</font>

238
00:19:02,620 --> 00:19:03,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If this was revenge,</font>

239
00:19:03,990 --> 00:19:06,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then why did you not come at me
with the kung fu techniques of Ryudoin?</font>

240
00:19:09,790 --> 00:19:13,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That day, though he was
the only man left,</font>

241
00:19:13,630 --> 00:19:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your father refused to surrender,</font>

242
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:19,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but fairly and sportingly confronted me
with kung fu.</font>

243
00:19:22,760 --> 00:19:27,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Out of respect to your father,
I faced him one-on-one.</font>

244
00:19:28,680 --> 00:19:32,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When the fight was finished,
your father smiled slightly,</font>

245
00:19:32,350 --> 00:19:34,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as if satisfied,
and said he would like to fight again.</font>

246
00:19:43,700 --> 00:19:47,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whether or not you believe me,
this is all there was to it.</font>

247
00:19:51,290 --> 00:19:53,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be
that what Father wanted to say</font>

248
00:19:53,500 --> 00:19:56,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was not that he wanted us
to defeat Master Guy,</font>

249
00:19:56,460 --> 00:19:59,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but that he wanted to fight again,
fair and square?</font>

250
00:20:01,090 --> 00:20:04,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have we had the wrong idea all along?</font>

251
00:20:04,300 --> 00:20:08,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I learned something important
from your father in that fight.</font>

252
00:20:09,810 --> 00:20:13,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is not the people born
with natural gifts who are the lucky ones.</font>

253
00:20:13,100 --> 00:20:16,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The truly fortunate are they who,
believing in themselves to the very end,</font>

254
00:20:16,900 --> 00:20:20,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">can go on striving and keep the flame
of their passions alive because of it.</font>

255
00:20:28,950 --> 00:20:31,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's
a good teacher-student relationship.</font>

256
00:20:31,710 --> 00:20:33,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

257
00:20:35,540 --> 00:20:40,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say, Sakura! Hurry up and get Bushy Brow
to Grandma's place, will you?</font>

258
00:20:40,550 --> 00:20:42,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it! Get him to the stretcher.</font>

259
00:20:42,340 --> 00:20:45,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, don't worry about me.
I'm okay. See to Yagura first.</font>

260
00:20:46,050 --> 00:20:49,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Speaking of which, I still haven't asked
for Yagura's real name.</font>

261
00:20:50,350 --> 00:20:53,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee, there'll be plenty of time
for that later.</font>

262
00:20:53,810 --> 00:20:56,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Administering first-aid should
take priority.</font>

263
00:20:56,400 --> 00:20:57,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes! Guy-sensei!</font>

264
00:20:57,690 --> 00:21:00,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yup, yup. That is really one
super teacher-student relationship.</font>

265
00:21:00,440 --> 00:21:02,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wish mine was as good.</font>

266
00:21:30,780 --> 00:21:33,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">hoshikuzu suchasucha sucha odoru</font></font></b></font></font>

267
00:21:30,780 --> 00:21:33,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">on a checkerboard night</font></font></b></font></font>

268
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:35,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">ichimatsu no yoru ni</font></font></b></font></font>

269
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:35,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">when the stardust's are rapidly dancing</font></font></b></font></font>

270
00:21:35,740 --> 00:21:40,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">aa mada kaeri takunai to kuchi ni wa dasenai naa</font></font></b></font></font>

271
00:21:35,740 --> 00:21:40,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">I just can't come out and say, "ah, I don't want to go home yet"</font></font></b></font></font>

272
00:21:41,700 --> 00:21:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">omowa seburi terii</font></font></b></font></font>

273
00:21:41,700 --> 00:21:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">suggestively</font></font></b></font></font>

274
00:21:44,080 --> 00:21:47,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">aisubeki kao ni tsuba wo misutaa kuriketto</font></font></b></font></font>

275
00:21:44,080 --> 00:21:47,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">spat at that beloved face, mister cricket</font></font></b></font></font>

276
00:21:49,800 --> 00:21:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">asekusai suteeji no ue de hikaru toronboon no</font></font></b></font></font>

277
00:21:49,800 --> 00:21:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">the trombone gradually going off-key</font></font></b></font></font>

278
00:21:54,880 --> 00:22:01,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">picchi ga dandan hazureteitteiru no mo kininaru kedo</font></font></b></font></font>

279
00:21:54,880 --> 00:22:01,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">while on the sweaty center stage does bug me</font></font></b></font></font>

280
00:22:01,350 --> 00:22:06,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">sonna koto yori kono nai mune no moyamoya wa sakki</font></font></b></font></font>

281
00:22:01,350 --> 00:22:06,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">but more importantly, the fuzziness I feel in my undeveloped chest,</font></font></b></font></font>

282
00:22:06,150 --> 00:22:13,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">nonda koora no sei kashira nee</font></font></b></font></font>

283
00:22:06,150 --> 00:22:13,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">I wonder If it's from that coke I just drank?</font></font></b></font></font>

284
00:22:40,330 --> 00:22:41,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Yo, Kiba, Neji!</font>

285
00:22:41,420 --> 00:22:43,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">As always, you have
no sense for tension.</font>

286
00:22:43,210 --> 00:22:45,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">— What was that?!
— Be quiet, you guys.</font>

287
00:22:45,050 --> 00:22:47,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">That's right. They are about to
give us important instructions.</font>

288
00:22:47,380 --> 00:22:49,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">— Okay...
— Choji too! Can't you eat a little later?</font>

289
00:22:49,630 --> 00:22:51,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">— I don't mind.
— That's not the point at all!</font>

290
00:22:52,010 --> 00:22:53,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">N-Naruto... Um... I...</font>

291
00:22:53,100 --> 00:22:54,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Things are heating up in here,
aren't they, Sakura?</font>

292
00:22:54,640 --> 00:22:55,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You are getting too excited.</font>

293
00:22:55,560 --> 00:22:56,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Hey. We're all here.</font>

294
00:22:56,560 --> 00:22:59,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Then, I'll explain the next mission.</font>

295
00:22:59,560 --> 00:23:03,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"A Tough Pinch! The Konoha 11 All Gather."</font>

